],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":37,"usage":{"completion_tokens":30,"prompt_tokens":2952}},{"content":"Thank you for turning off Airplane Mode. Since you’re still seeing \"No Signal,\" the next step is to check your SIM card status. Please check if your phone shows any messages about the SIM card (such as \"SIM missing\" or \"SIM locked\"), or if you can access your SIM card settings.\n\nIf you’re not sure, try removing your SIM card and reinserting it to ensure it’s properly seated. After reinserting, restart your phone and check if the signal returns.\n\nLet me know what you see regarding your SIM card status, or if this step resolves the issue.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":38,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T17:24:51.068013","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":38,"usage":{"completion_tokens":121,"prompt_tokens":8441}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":39,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T17:24:52.399281","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_g2yEAkQehHMU4H2ukWrpZyzZ","name":"check_sim_status","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":39,"usage":{"completion_tokens":12,"prompt_tokens":3107}},{"content":"Your SIM card is active and working.","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":40,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T17:24:52.399736","tool_call_id":"call_g2yEAkQehHMU4H2ukWrpZyzZ","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":40,"usage":null},{"content":"I checked the SIM card status, and it shows that the SIM card is active and working. What should I try next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":41,"thinking_blocks":null,"tim